  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When i want write something in Home world, i noticed VRChat removed the colored pencils and replaced it with pencils - same version used in earlier world jam.\nIf you think the new pencils are good... i am sorry, they sucks.\n\nI discovered the pencils are limited to 5 strokes. That means if you draw 5 lines and then release trigger every time, you will see the earlier draw-ed lines will disappear too early.\n\nIt means you cannot draw image with it, because earlier lines vanished already! It's really useless new pencils!\nThe old pencils will not vanish already so you can keep drawing long time. They will erased with eraser only or global erase button. Same if you want write text, it just vanished already.\n\nSo yeah, the pencils are not good now in Home world. I suggest very strongly adjust the pencils OR remove it and replace with old pencils. Actually current pencils drawed lines are also not great.\n\nI don't understand why you put poor pencils in the world. What is wrong with old pencils?",
